  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Escalating kinetic attacks raise perceptions of systemic geopolitical and supply‑chain risk, prompting firms and investors to accelerate reshoring and friend‑shoring of auto and related tech production into Europe, increasing manufacturing investment flows.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">china_west_rivalry</data>
</edge>
