  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Weakening of major reserve currencies raises the local-currency cost of imported spare parts, maintenance services, and foreign-denominated insurance/premia, reducing the ability of airports, terminals and refineries to sustain full operational capacity over the medium term.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_volatility</data>
  <data key="d40">gulf_proxy_campaign</data>
</edge>
