  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained high oil prices erode industrial competitiveness and provoke political pressure to protect domestic auto/tech industries, prompting policymakers to introduce tighter trade measures (tariffs, quotas, local-content rules) over the policy cycle.</data>
