  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Elevated geopolitical tension raises perceived and actual risk to commercial aviation (overflight danger, missile/drone threats, insurance/NOTAMs), prompting carriers to cancel or reroute flights and increase cancellations rapidly.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_volatility</data>
