  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A surge in cross‑border investment flows from Chinese investors into European auto and tech assets raises domestic political and security concerns, prompting lawmakers and regulators to tighten trade and investment restrictions on vehicle and related technology imports.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
